      "id": "experiment:lean-control",
      "type": "Experiment",
      "label": "The lean control",
      "description": "What: lean (code tools plus companion's prompt line): where companion never called kg, the prompt line explains all of the saving. Where it did, the graph halved the context (−56%) at the same score, at +35% time. On scr-impact-job-runtime lean scored 1.00 (104 s), companion 0.50. The graph never improved accuracy.",
